[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1096","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1123","title":"IBM AIX 4.3.x pioout 命令缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"这是一个关于 AIX 操作系统 pioout 命令的缓冲区溢出漏洞，影响 IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本。通过精心构造的命令参数，攻击者可以覆盖相邻内存区域，导致程序控制流紊乱，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞为本地权限提升型，攻击者无需身份验证即可利用，可在目标系统中获得完全控制权限， compromising 系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。漏洞的 CVSS 评分达到 7.2 (AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C)，属于高危等级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1123"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY12638&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2036","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5617","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1123","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1123.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1123.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1123.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1095","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1122","title":"IBM AIX setclock 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本的 setclock 命令存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 setclock 命令传递超长参数触发溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意 Shellcode，从而获取完整系统控制权限。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本，攻击者需具备本地登录权限且无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），成功利用可完全破坏系统机密性、完整性和可用性。IBM 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1122"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 IBM AIX 至 4.3.3 或更高版本（建议升级至 AIX 5.1 或更高版本），并应用 IBM 安全补丁 IY17034 (AIX 4.3.3) 或 IY17035 (AIX 4.2.1)。临时缓解措施：移除 /usr/sbin/setclock 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/setclock），或通过 sudo 限制普通用户执行该命令。如无法升级，建议限制本地用户登录权限并启用审计监控 setclock 执行记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY07790&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY07831&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2035","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1122","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1122.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1122.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1122.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1094","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1118","title":"24Link Web Server 安全绕过漏洞","description":"24Link 1.06 Web 服务器存在访问控制绕过漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 HTTP GET 请求路径前添加 \"/+/\" 或 \"/.\" 等特殊字符串，可绕过服务器的访问限制规则，未经授权访问受保护的资源或目录。该漏洞影响 24Link 1.06 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前官方已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1118"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"24Link 1.06 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache httpd 2.4 或 Nginx），并在迁移前通过反向代理或 WAF 规则拦截包含 \"/+/\" 或 \"/.\" 等异常路径的 HTTP GET 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0369.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1118","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1118.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1118.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27ef30b72e2251e5a09f792eabf726cf380537a6/api/2000/CVE-2000-1118.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1094.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1094.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1093","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1117","title":"Lotus Notes Client R5 Java虚拟机文件存在性检测信息泄露漏洞","description":"Lotus Notes Client R5 中 Java 虚拟机（JVM）的扩展控制列表（ECL）功能存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过恶意网站利用 getSystemResource 方法执行时间的可观测差异，探测客户端本地文件系统中特定文件是否存在。该漏洞利用条件简单，无需认证即可远程触发，影响 Lotus Notes Client R5 系列版本，可能导致敏感文件路径信息泄露，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1117"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"升级至 HCL Notes 最新版本（14.x 或 12.x），启用严格 ECL 策略，将未签名 Java 小程序权限设为\"不允许\"。临时缓解措施：在浏览器中禁用 Java 插件，通过防火墙阻止不可信站点的 Java 内容加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0341.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1117","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1117.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1117.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1117.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1092","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1115","title":"602Pro LAN SUITE 远程Web管理组件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"602Pro LAN SUITE 2000.0.1.33 之前版本中的远程 Web 管理组件（webprox.dll）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送超长 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 602Pro LAN SUITE 2000.0.1.33 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1115"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 602Pro LAN SUITE 至 2000.0.1.33 或更高版本，该版本修复了 webprox.dll 中处理 GET 请求时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，在防火墙中限制对远程 Web 管理端口（默认 80/8080）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的 Web 管理功能。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新的替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0299.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1979","http://www.software602.com/products/ls/support/newbuild.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5583","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1115","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2000/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1115.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1115.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1115.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1092.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1091","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1111","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet Service 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 Professional 系统的 Telnet 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，该服务未能正确终止不完整的连接尝试。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标系统的 Telnet 服务端口发起 TCP 连接，但在建立连接后不发送任何输入数据即可触发漏洞，导致服务无法正常处理后续连接请求，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 Professional 的 Telnet 服务组件，攻击者只需从网络可达位置向目标 23 端口发起连接并保持静默，即可使服务陷入等待状态，消耗系统资源并拒绝合法用户的远程管理访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1111"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已针对此漏洞发布安全补丁，受影响系统应安装 Windows 2000 Service Pack 2 或更高版本累积更新以修复 Telnet 服务连接处理缺陷。如无法立即安装补丁，可暂时禁用 Telnet 服务以缓解风险：依次打开「控制面板」→「管理工具」→「服务」，找到「Telnet」服务并将启动类型设为「已禁用」。建议优先将系统升级至受支持的 Windows 版本，以彻底消除安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/147914","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2018","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5598","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1111","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/63a203d15e6082e0a2448fddec7f93c9d2fb2463/2000/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1111.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1111.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1111.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1090","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1109","title":"GNU Midnight Commander 目录名特殊字符处理不当导致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Midnight Commander (mc) 4.5.51 及更早版本在处理畸形目录名时存在权限提升漏洞。当用户使用 mc 打开包含特殊字符的目录时，目录名中嵌入的命令会被执行，导致本地攻击者可通过创建包含特殊字符及待执行命令的恶意目录来获取更高权限。该漏洞影响 Midnight Commander 4.5.51 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1109"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"升级 Midnight Commander 至 4.5.51 以上版本，该版本修复了目录名中特殊字符的处理逻辑，避免将目录名内容传递给 shell 执行。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-036 安全公告获取对应发行版的补丁包，SUSE Linux 用户可参考 SuSE-SA:2001:11 公告进行更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0373.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-036","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_011_mc.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2016","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5929","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1109","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1109.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2000/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1109.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-1109.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1089","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1108","title":"Midnight Commander cons.saver 符号链接文件破坏漏洞","description":"Midnight Commander（mc）4.5.42 及更早版本中的 cons.saver 程序未能正确验证输出文件描述符是否为 TTY，存在符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建指向目标文件的符号链接，调用 mc 并将该链接指定为 TTY 参数，导致 cons.saver 将输出写入任意文件，从而破坏系统文件或用户数据。攻击需要本地访问权限，无需认证，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1108"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"升级 Midnight Commander 至 4.5.43 或更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-2000-11-25 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户应安装 MDKSA-2000-078 安全更新。如无法升级，避免在不可信环境中以 root 权限运行 mc，并限制本地用户创建符号链接的能力作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0192.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001125","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-078.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1945","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5519","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1108","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2000/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1108.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1108.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-1108.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1088","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1107","title":"SuSE Linux in.identd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.x 及 7.0 版本中自带的 in.identd 身份识别服务存在空指针解引用漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统的 ident 服务发送超长请求，触发服务程序访问空指针导致进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可远程利用，影响 SuSE Linux 6.x 和 7.0 全系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1107"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"升级 SuSE Linux 至 7.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 in.identd 长请求导致空指针崩溃的问题。如无法升级，可执行 `rcidentd stop && chkconfig identd off` 关闭 identd 服务（非必需服务），并在防火墙使用 `iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 113 -j DROP` 阻断外部 ident 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0387.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5590","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1107","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2000/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1107.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1107.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1107.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1087","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1106","title":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 权限提升漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 在安装过程中会创建名为 \"Intscan\" 的网络共享，指向 \"InterScan\" 目录，但该共享的权限设置存在严重缺陷——默认授予 Everyone 组完全控制（Full Control）权限。本地攻击者可通过访问该共享，直接修改 VirusWall 程序文件（如可执行程序或配置文件），从而提升权限至系统级，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 所有受影响的版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1106"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"立即移除\"Intscan\"网络共享，或修改其权限为仅允许管理员完全控制，删除Everyone组的完全控制权限。如Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall仍在运行，建议升级到已修复此问题的最新版本或迁移至替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0016.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/147563","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2014","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5606","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1106","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2000/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1106.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1106.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-1106.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1086","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1102","title":"PTlink IRCD 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PTlink IRCD 3.5.3 及配套的 PTlink Services 1.8.1 存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 IRC 守护进程在处理用户发送的特制命令时缺乏充分的输入验证与边界检查。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含恶意参数的命令（如\"mode +owgscfxeb\"及\"oper\"命令），触发 IRCD 进程内部的异常处理逻辑，导致服务器进程崩溃并停止服务。该漏洞影响运行 PTlink IRCD 3.5.3 或 PTlink Services 1.8.1 的 IRC 服务器实例，攻击者无需预先获得账户权限或完成身份认证即可发起攻击。攻击成功后将造成 IRC 服务中断，所有在线用户被迫断开连接，影响服务的可用性与正常运行。CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级为中等。建议受影响用户升级至修复版本或应用相关安全补丁以消除该拒绝服务风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1102"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"立即将 PTlink IRCD 升级至更新版本，或迁移至受维护的 IRC 服务端（如 ircd-hybrid、InspIRCd 等）；若暂无法升级，应在防火墙层面限制对 IRCD 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的 oper 命令授权。同时升级 PTlink Services 至安全版本，防止攻击者通过 mode +owgscfxeb 及 oper 命令触发服务端崩溃。建议定期审查 oper 权限配置，移除不必要的全局操作员账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/147115","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2008","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1102","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/20ec019115a0b1de7bc97fc35bb5f73fa34a0aae/2000/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1102.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1102.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1102.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1085","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1101","title":"Winsock WFTPD 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Winsock FTPd (WFTPD) 3.00 及 2.41 版本在启用\"限制到家目录\"选项时存在目录遍历漏洞。本地用户可通过在路径中构造 \"/../\" 字符串绕过目录限制，逃逸出家目录访问系统其他文件，属于典型的点号点号（..）攻击变种。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1101"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"立即升级到最新的 WFTPD 版本（如 3.10 及以上），或直接迁移到支持安全更新的现代 FTP 服务器（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD）。在升级前，可临时通过防火墙禁用 FTP 端口，限制管理界面访问权限，并确保仅在内部网络环境中使用此服务。无法立即升级的情况下，建议完全禁用 FTP 服务，或将其部署在隔离的 DMZ 区域，并严格限制访问权限为信任主机。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0386.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5608.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2005","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1101","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/80a58667e7dc9efd6d76b74cf4de29bd42310fd5/2000/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1101.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1101.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1101.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1084","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1099","title":"Sun Java Development Kit (JDK) Java沙箱逃逸漏洞","description":"JDK 1.2.2_05 及更早版本中的 Java 运行时环境存在沙箱逃逸漏洞，由于未对不可信 Java 类的类加载调用进行充分限制，导致攻击者可通过诱导用户运行恶意 Java 小程序或应用程序，使不可信 Java 类调用被禁止的内部类，从而突破 Java 沙箱安全机制，在目标系统上执行未授权操作，造成机密性、完整性和可用性受影响。攻击条件要求用户交互且利用复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1099"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"升级到 JDK 1.2.2_06 或更高版本，该版本修复了不受信任 Java 类调用被禁止类的问题。如无法升级，可在安全策略文件中限制不可信代码的权限，或使用 SecurityManager 严格限制类加载范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/199&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.osvdb.org/7255","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0011-132","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5605","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1099","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2000/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1099.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1099.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1099.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1083","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1098","title":"SonicWALL SOHO Firewall 4.0/5.0 Web服务器空请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SonicWALL SOHO Firewall 4.0/5.0 版本的 Web 管理界面存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标设备发送特制的空 GET 或 POST HTTP 请求，可导致 Web 服务器进程崩溃，造成管理界面不可用，影响设备正常管理。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，仅需网络访问即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1098"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"升级 SonicWALL SOHO 防火墙固件至 5.0.0.3 及以上版本（该漏洞在 5.0.0.3 中修复）。如无法升级，在防火墙管理界面中关闭 Web 管理功能（仅通过串口或 SSH 管理），或在网络层面限制对防火墙 Web 管理端口（默认 80/443）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0435.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0439.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1098","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2000/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1098.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1098.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1098.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1083.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1083.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1082","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1097","title":"SonicWALL SOHO Firewall 4.0/5.0 Web Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SonicWALL SOHO Firewall 4.0 及 5.0 版本内置的 Web 服务器在处理认证页面时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向登录页面提交超长用户名，触发缓冲区溢出导致 Web 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SonicWALL SOHO 系列防火墙设备，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可实施，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1097"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SonicWALL SOHO 防火墙固件至最新版本（该产品已停产，建议迁移至 SonicWALL TZ 系列等受支持型号）。如无法升级，可在防火墙管理界面中将 Web 管理访问限制为仅允许受信任的内部 IP 地址，并在网络边界 ACL 中阻断对 443 端口的非授权外部访问，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0406.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0435.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1667","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2013","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvel